  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1736711922_327386_c662857823f1bdcd7547da8e5246d7a5.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">At&nbsp;<strong>Prideful Roots</strong>, we celebrate Black culture, heritage, and excellence through our premium apparel and accessories. Our mission is to empower individuals to honor their history, embrace their identity, and express their pride. Every design tells a story of resilience, empowerment, and cultural pride. By partnering with us, you join a movement that uplifts and inspires.&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The&nbsp;<strong>\"Dream Like King\" Black History Icon Hoodie</strong> is a tribute to the legacy of Dr. Martin Luther King Jr., featuring a vibrant, bold design that celebrates his dream of equality and justice. Made from the popular <strong>Gildan 18500 Heavy Blend&trade;</strong>, this unisex hoodie offers unparalleled comfort and durability. It&rsquo;s perfect for men, women, and teens who want to honor Black history in style.</span></p>\r\n<h4><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Features:</strong></span></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Material</strong>: 50% cotton, 50% polyester blend for a soft and durable feel.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Design</strong>: Vibrant graphic of Martin Luther King Jr. with the inspirational message \"Dream Like King.\"</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Fit</strong>: Relaxed, unisex fit suitable for all-day wear.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Occasions</strong>: Ideal for Black History Month, Martin Luther King Jr. Day, or as a meaningful gift.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Care</strong>: Machine washable, maintaining vibrant colors and softness after every wash.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Empowering Design</strong>: A unique, inspirational hoodie that celebrates Black history and honors the legacy of Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Premium Quality</strong>: Crafted using Gildan 18500 Heavy Blend&trade;, ensuring superior comfort, warmth, and durability.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Inclusive Appeal</strong>: Designed for men, women, and teens to wear with pride.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Social Impact</strong>: By purchasing or promoting this product, you&rsquo;re supporting a brand dedicated to empowering and uplifting Black voices.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Commission</strong>: Earn 20% per sale through the affiliate program.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Frequency</strong>: Monthly payouts via PayPal.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Tracking</strong>: Affiliates receive unique affiliate link and tracking links for transparent performance monitoring.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Discount Offer</strong>: Customers can enjoy 10% off with the code <strong>PRWELCOME10</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Shipping</strong>: Free shipping for orders over $50. Competitive rates for international shipping.</span></li>\r\n</ul>",
